Copyright AdminHead

This plugin is adapted from the sibling gh-readme plugin in this marketplace,
which carries the credits below. SKILL.md, references/templates.md,
references/audit-checklist.md, references/badges-and-visuals.md and
scripts/readme_audit.sh follow gh-readme's text with Forgejo changes (forge
gate, README lookup order, badge endpoints, no <picture>, no GitHub-specific
claims). references/forgejo-rendering.md is new, written from the Forgejo
source (codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo, branch forgejo).

